            "subject": "LU-20869 tests: shrink file counts in sanity 123f and 123h"
          }
        ],
        "author": {
          "name": "Patrick Farrell",
          "email": "patrick@thelustrecollective.com",
          "date": "2026-10-30 20:01:23.000000000",
          "tz": -300
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Oleg Drokin",
          "email": "green@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-11-11 06:40:28.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-20076 tests: read all servers at once in wait_nm_sync",
        "message": "LU-20076 tests: read all servers at once in wait_nm_sync\n\nwait_nm_sync took about 9 remote commands per call on three\nserver nodes: a NID lookup and a get_param per server, each its\nown ssh, plus the MGS lookups. It runs about 500 times per\nsanity-sec run, and is a third of that suite's time.\n\nAssuming time scales with remote-command count, reducing 9 to 3\nprojects a 2/9 (22%) saving for sanity-sec. Rainshadow records\n1,546 review-dne-part-2 runs averaging 7,148 seconds over\nOctober 1-30, 2026: about 26 minutes per run, or 680 suite-hours\nin that window. This is an overhead-based estimate using the\none-third profile share above, not a measured before/after\nsaving. Other configurations and callers in sanity, sanityn,\nsanity-quota and sanity-hsm are not included in that estimate.\n\nCompare host names rather than NIDs, and read all the servers\nwith one command per pass, which leaves 2 or 3 per call.\n\nA pass is now much shorter, so 10 passes would no longer allow\nthe time they took on CI, where each cost seconds of ssh. Wait\nup to 40 seconds rather than 10 passes, and report the seconds\nwaited. A real sync failure is reported after those 40 seconds.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-sec\nTest-Parameters: mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanity-sec\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Iea781dace01af90058f95ad17cc6429fe45fb547\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/70268\nReviewed-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
